@TailorService.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5260
@TailorId = replace-with-id-returned-by-post

### Register a tailor
POST {{TailorService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tailors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Lopez"
}

### Get a tailor by ID (replace with the ID returned by POST)
GET {{TailorService.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tailors/{{TailorId}}
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{TailorService.Api_HostAddress}}/health
